000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. EXPRSIZE.
000300* Expression work areas are sized to the digits each node can
000400* have. Every operator at mixed scales, results wider than their
000500* operands, literals and COMP-3 items taken in place, division by
000600* zero under SIZE ERROR, wide and SIGN-clause operands, edited
000700* receivers, and expressions in IF, TIMES and VARYING.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
000900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001000 01  P1           PIC S9(5)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 123.45.
001100 01  P2           PIC S9(5)V99 COMP-3 VALUE -1.01.
001200 01  P3           PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
001300 01  D1           PIC 9(7)     VALUE 1234567.
001400 01  D2           PIC 9(3)V999 VALUE 2.125.
001500 01  D3           PIC S9(11)V9(4) VALUE 0.
001600 01  C1           PIC S9(8)  COMP VALUE 100000.
001700 01  C2           PIC S9(4)  COMP VALUE -7.
001800 01  W1           PIC 9(18)  VALUE 123456789012345678.
001900 01  W2           PIC S9(18) VALUE 0.
002000 01  L1           PIC S9(5) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE VALUE -250.
002100 01  T1           PIC S9(7)V9(3) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
002200 01  N1           PIC 9(4)   VALUE 0.
002300 01  Z0           PIC 9      VALUE 0.
002400 01  E1           PIC -(9)9.99.
002500 01  E2           PIC -(11)9.9999.
002600 01  E3           PIC -(18)9.
002700 01  E4           PIC -(7)9.999.
002800 01  K            PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
002900 01  V            PIC S9(5)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
002950 01  K2           PIC 99 COMP-3 VALUE 12.
003000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003100 MAIN.
003200     COMPUTE P3 = P1 * P2 + P1.
003300     MOVE P3 TO E1. DISPLAY 'MUL ADD   ' E1.
003400     COMPUTE P3 = P1 * P2 * P2 - 1000.
003500     MOVE P3 TO E1. DISPLAY 'MUL MUL   ' E1.
003600     COMPUTE P3 = P1 / P2.
003700     MOVE P3 TO E1. DISPLAY 'DIV       ' E1.
003800     COMPUTE P3 ROUNDED = P1 / 7.
003900     MOVE P3 TO E1. DISPLAY 'DIV LIT R ' E1.
004000     COMPUTE P3 = D1 / D2.
004100     MOVE P3 TO E1. DISPLAY 'DIV DISP  ' E1.
004200     COMPUTE D3 = P1 * D2.
004300     MOVE D3 TO E2. DISPLAY 'SHIFT LEFT' E2.
004400     COMPUTE D3 = C1 + C2 * 3.
004500     MOVE D3 TO E2. DISPLAY 'COMP      ' E2.
004600     COMPUTE D3 = - P1 + 0.5.
004700     MOVE D3 TO E2. DISPLAY 'NEG       ' E2.
004800     COMPUTE D3 = P1 ** 2 - 1.
004900     MOVE D3 TO E2. DISPLAY 'POW       ' E2.
005000     COMPUTE W2 = W1 - 123456789012345000.
005100     MOVE W2 TO E3. DISPLAY 'WIDE      ' E3.
005200     COMPUTE W2 = W1 / 1000.
005300     MOVE W2 TO E3. DISPLAY 'WIDE DIV  ' E3.
005400     COMPUTE D3 = L1 * 2 + P2.
005500     MOVE D3 TO E2. DISPLAY 'SIGN LEAD ' E2.
005600     COMPUTE E1 = P1 + P2.
005700     DISPLAY 'EDITED    ' E1.
005800     COMPUTE T1 = P1 / 3.
005900     MOVE T1 TO E4. DISPLAY 'DIV V999  ' E4.
006000     COMPUTE T1 = (P1 + P2) * (P1 - P2) / (P1 + 1).
006100     MOVE T1 TO E4. DISPLAY 'NESTED    ' E4.
006200     COMPUTE T1 = 99999.99 * 99999.99.
006300     MOVE T1 TO E4. DISPLAY 'BIG LITS  ' E4.
006400     MOVE 5 TO N1.
006500     COMPUTE N1 = N1 / Z0
006600         ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY 'DIV ZERO  SIZE ERROR ' N1.
006700     COMPUTE N1 = N1 / 0
006800         ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY 'DIV ZERO L SIZE ERROR ' N1.
006900     COMPUTE N1 = 1234 * 9
007000         ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY 'TOO BIG   SIZE ERROR ' N1.
007100     DISPLAY 'AFTER     ' N1.
007200     COMPUTE N1 = 1234 * 8
007300         ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY 'TOO BIG   SIZE ERROR ' N1.
007400     DISPLAY 'AFTER     ' N1.
007500     IF P1 + P2 > P1 * 0.99 DISPLAY 'IF GREATER'
007600         ELSE DISPLAY 'IF NOT GREATER'.
007700     IF P1 * P2 < -100 DISPLAY 'IF LESS'
007800         ELSE DISPLAY 'IF NOT LESS'.
007900     IF D1 / 7 = 176366.7142857 DISPLAY 'IF EQUAL'
008000         ELSE DISPLAY 'IF NOT EQUAL'.
008100     MOVE 0 TO K.
008200     PERFORM COUNT-ONE K2 TIMES.
008300     DISPLAY 'TIMES     ' K.
008400     MOVE 0 TO K.
008500     PERFORM COUNT-ONE VARYING V FROM P2 BY 1.5
008600         UNTIL V > 5.
008700     MOVE V TO E1. DISPLAY 'VARYING   ' K ' ' E1.
008800     STOP RUN.
008900 COUNT-ONE.
009000     ADD 1 TO K.
